The actual metadata decision point is:

```rust
if !options.metadata_filters.is_empty()
    && !self.metadata_matches(&key, &options.metadata_filters)
{
    return None;
}
```

So `--meta` excludes a document by returning `None` from the `filter_map` inside `DocumentFinder::find`; only documents that survive that closure become part of the sorted and limited result set.

